{"id":"343cd2798c360ffe","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-domain-model.md","title":"反身 dcpo 的 λ 范畴模型","display":"thm-domain-model — 反身 dcpo 的 λ 范畴模型","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-domain-model","aliases":["16-thm-domain-model","16-thm--domain-model"],"display":"thm-domain-model — 反身 dcpo 的 λ 范畴模型","depends_on":["[[16-df-cpo]]","[[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]","[[16-thm-dcpo-exponential]]","[[16-df-lambda-category]]","[[16-df-category]]"],"review_status":"resolved-categorical-model","review_priority":"P1","review_note_id":"J11","review_date":"2026-10-15","source":"Lemma 2.5.2 p. 155 (PDF 175); Example 2.5.3(ii) p. 156 (PDF 176)","revision_date":"2026-10-19","verification_status":"proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-domain-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-domain-model</span><span>16-thm--domain-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-domain-model — 反身 dcpo 的 λ 范畴模型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d561a55729f9cdb8\" href=\"?note=d561a55729f9cdb8\" title=\"16-df-cpo\">16-df-cpo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a101152a4f31cd83\" href=\"?note=a101152a4f31cd83\" title=\"16-df-dcpo-function-space\">16-df-dcpo-function-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e7c6dac50ba7c59\" href=\"?note=6e7c6dac50ba7c59\" title=\"16-thm-dcpo-exponential\">16-thm-dcpo-exponential</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9d52b8330bc1b384\" href=\"?note=9d52b8330bc1b384\" title=\"16-df-lambda-category\">16-df-lambda-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"resolved-categorical-model"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P1"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J11"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-15"},{"key":"source","html":"Lemma 2.5.2 p. 155 (PDF 175); Example 2.5.3(ii) p. 156 (PDF 176)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 为小 dcpo，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha:D\\to[D,D]\">\\(\\alpha:D\\to[D,D]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta:[D,D]\\to D\">\\(\\beta:[D,D]\\to D\\)</span> 连续且互逆；函数空间见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a101152a4f31cd83\" href=\"?note=a101152a4f31cd83\" title=\"16-df-dcpo-function-space\">16-df-dcpo-function-space</a>，其指数定理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6e7c6dac50ba7c59\" href=\"?note=6e7c6dac50ba7c59\" title=\"16-thm-dcpo-exponential\">16-thm-dcpo-exponential</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^0=\\{()\\}\">\\(D^0=\\{()\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^n\">\\(D^n\\)</span> 取逐点序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_D\">\\(\\mathcal D_D\\)</span> 的对象为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>，态射为带源靶标签的连续函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle n,m,f\\rangle\">\\(\\langle n,m,f\\rangle\\)</span>；下式规定六元组范畴的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,e,c\">\\(s,t,e,c\\)</span>。积结构公式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:D^k\\to D^n\">\\(f:D^k\\to D^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:D^k\\to D^m\">\\(g:D^k\\to D^m\\)</span> 为连续函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^n\">\\(D^n\\)</span> 的坐标从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 开始，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^1\">\\(D^1\\)</span> 的元素是单元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(d)\">\\((d)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_D:D^2\\to D^1\">\\(a_D:D^2\\to D^1\\)</span> 为下文定义的带单元组输出的应用函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_D\">\\(\\mathcal D_D\\)</span> 的终对象是自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，指定反身对象是自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>；它们分别代表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^0\">\\(D^0\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^1\">\\(D^1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LambdaStr}\">\\(\\mathrm{LambdaStr}\\)</span> 使用下文给出的终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>、积对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\otimes m\">\\(n\\otimes m\\)</span>、投影与配对。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\mathbin{+\\!+}\\sigma\">\\(\\rho\\mathbin{+\\!+}\\sigma\\)</span> 表示长度分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\">\\(n,m\\)</span> 的有限元组拼接；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{&lt;n}\">\\(\\tau_{&lt;n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\ge n}\">\\(\\tau_{\\ge n}\\)</span> 分别为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\">\\(n,m\\)</span> 的两段。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LambdaStr}\">\\(\\mathrm{LambdaStr}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9d52b8330bc1b384\" href=\"?note=9d52b8330bc1b384\" title=\"16-df-lambda-category\">16-df-lambda-category</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_D\">\\(\\Lambda_D\\)</span> 下文取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^{n+1}=D^n\\times D\">\\(D^{n+1}=D^n\\times D\\)</span> 的坐标约定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^n\\to D\">\\(D^n\\to D\\)</span> 的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 对应到对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的范畴箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle n,1,\\rho\\mapsto(g(\\rho))\\rangle\">\\(\\langle n,1,\\rho\\mapsto(g(\\rho))\\rangle\\)</span>。应用与抽象的定义式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in D\">\\(x,y\\in D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in D^n\">\\(\\rho\\in D^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in[D^{n+1},D]\">\\(f\\in[D^{n+1},D]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_D\">\\(\\Lambda_D\\)</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 形成函数族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LambdaModel}(D)\">\\(\\mathrm{LambdaModel}(D)\\)</span> 是本页明确限定的存在结构谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ScottCont}\">\\(\\mathrm{ScottCont}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d561a55729f9cdb8\" href=\"?note=d561a55729f9cdb8\" title=\"16-df-cpo\">16-df-cpo</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LambdaModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{LambdaModel}\\)</span> 是本页定义的新谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbb N,\\\\\nM_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,m,f\\rangle\\mid n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(f,D^n,D^m)\\},\\\\\ns_D\\langle n,m,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq n,&amp;t_D\\langle n,m,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq m,\\\\\ne_D(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle n,n,\\operatorname{id}_{D^n}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_D(\\langle m,k,g\\rangle,\\langle n,m,f\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle n,k,g\\circ f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal D_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,e_D,c_D\\rangle,\\\\\n!_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle n,0,\\rho\\mapsto()\\rangle,\\qquad n\\otimes m\\coloneqq n+m,\\\\\n\\pi^{n,m}_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle n+m,n,\\tau\\mapsto\\tau_{&lt;n}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\pi^{n,m}_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle n+m,m,\\tau\\mapsto\\tau_{\\ge n}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\langle\\langle k,n,f\\rangle,\\langle k,m,g\\rangle\\rangle_D\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle k,n+m,\\rho\\mapsto f(\\rho)\\mathbin{+\\!+}g(\\rho)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\star_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,1,()\\mapsto(\\beta(\\operatorname{id}_D))\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{app}_D&amp;:D^2\\to D,\\qquad\n\\Lambda_D:[D^{n+1},D]\\to[D^n,D],\\\\\n\\operatorname{app}_D(x,y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha(x)(y),\\\\\na_D(x,y)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{app}_D(x,y)),\\\\\n\\Lambda_D(f)(\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\beta(y\\mapsto f(\\rho,y)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LambdaModel}(D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists\\alpha,\\beta)\\bigl[\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\alpha,D,[D,D])\\land\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\beta,[D,D],D)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\alpha\\beta=\\operatorname{id}_{[D,D]}\n\\land\\beta\\alpha=\\operatorname{id}_D\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbb N,\\\\\nM_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,m,f\\rangle\\mid n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(f,D^n,D^m)\\},\\\\\ns_D\\langle n,m,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq n,&amp;t_D\\langle n,m,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq m,\\\\\ne_D(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle n,n,\\operatorname{id}_{D^n}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_D(\\langle m,k,g\\rangle,\\langle n,m,f\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle n,k,g\\circ f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal D_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,e_D,c_D\\rangle,\\\\\n!_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle n,0,\\rho\\mapsto()\\rangle,\\qquad n\\otimes m\\coloneqq n+m,\\\\\n\\pi^{n,m}_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle n+m,n,\\tau\\mapsto\\tau_{&lt;n}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\pi^{n,m}_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle n+m,m,\\tau\\mapsto\\tau_{\\ge n}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\langle\\langle k,n,f\\rangle,\\langle k,m,g\\rangle\\rangle_D\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle k,n+m,\\rho\\mapsto f(\\rho)\\mathbin{+\\!+}g(\\rho)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\star_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,1,()\\mapsto(\\beta(\\operatorname{id}_D))\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{app}_D&amp;:D^2\\to D,\\qquad\n\\Lambda_D:[D^{n+1},D]\\to[D^n,D],\\\\\n\\operatorname{app}_D(x,y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha(x)(y),\\\\\na_D(x,y)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{app}_D(x,y)),\\\\\n\\Lambda_D(f)(\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\beta(y\\mapsto f(\\rho,y)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LambdaModel}(D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists\\alpha,\\beta)\\bigl[\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\alpha,D,[D,D])\\land\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\beta,[D,D],D)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\alpha\\beta=\\operatorname{id}_{[D,D]}\n\\land\\beta\\alpha=\\operatorname{id}_D\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal D_D),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{LambdaStr}(\\mathcal D_D,1,\\langle2,1,a_D\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{LambdaModel}(D),\\\\\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N)(\\forall f\\in[D^{n+1},D])(\\forall\\rho\\in D^n)(\\forall y\\in D)\\\n\\operatorname{app}_D(\\Lambda_D(f)(\\rho),y)=f(\\rho,y),\\\\\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N)(\\forall h\\in[D^n,D])\\\n\\Lambda_D((\\rho,y)\\mapsto\\operatorname{app}_D(h(\\rho),y))=h.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal D_D),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{LambdaStr}(\\mathcal D_D,1,\\langle2,1,a_D\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{LambdaModel}(D),\\\\\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N)(\\forall f\\in[D^{n+1},D])(\\forall\\rho\\in D^n)(\\forall y\\in D)\\\n\\operatorname{app}_D(\\Lambda_D(f)(\\rho),y)=f(\\rho,y),\\\\\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N)(\\forall h\\in[D^n,D])\\\n\\Lambda_D((\\rho,y)\\mapsto\\operatorname{app}_D(h(\\rho),y))=h.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：连续函数的恒等与复合满足范畴律。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 终；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+m\">\\(n+m\\)</span> 的积投影为分块坐标投影，配对为拼接。由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta(\\operatorname{id}_D)\\in D\">\\(\\beta(\\operatorname{id}_D)\\in D\\)</span> 知 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 非空，故对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 有全局元素。求值、柯里化定理说明 app 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_D(f)\">\\(\\Lambda_D(f)\\)</span> 连续。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\beta=\\operatorname{id}\">\\(\\alpha\\beta=\\operatorname{id}\\)</span> 给出第一条 β 方程。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 也满足应用方程，则逐点有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha(h(\\rho))=(y\\mapsto f(\\rho,y))\">\\(\\alpha(h(\\rho))=(y\\mapsto f(\\rho,y))\\)</span>，应用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h=\\Lambda_D(f)\">\\(h=\\Lambda_D(f)\\)</span>；这给出所需唯一性及 η 方程。</p>\n<p>来源：Example 2.5.3(ii), p. 156 (PDF 176)；泛性质为 Lemma 2.5.2, p. 155 (PDF 175)。本页完整构造书中的有限幂基范畴，并核对 λ 范畴接口；没有把两个 β/η 元素等式直接替代范畴构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LambdaModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{LambdaModel}\\)</span> 在此限定为反身 dcpo 模型存在性，不是未经定义的任意演算可靠性谓词。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"6cb45d716150df5b\" href=\"?note=6cb45d716150df5b\" title=\"16-thm-inverse-limit\">16-thm-inverse-limit</a> 给出一项有本地证明的具体反身域构造。</p>\n<p>本轮型属复核：有限幂以元组编码时，应用箭头的靶必须为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^1\">\\(D^1\\)</span> 而非裸 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>。现显式补入单元组；抽象函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_D(f):D^n\\to D\">\\(\\Lambda_D(f):D^n\\to D\\)</span> 对应范畴箭头的单元组函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\mapsto(\\Lambda_D(f)(\\rho))\">\\(\\rho\\mapsto(\\Lambda_D(f)(\\rho))\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-cpo","status":"resolved","id":"d561a55729f9cdb8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cpo]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dcpo-function-space","status":"resolved","id":"a101152a4f31cd83","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-dcpo-exponential","status":"resolved","id":"6e7c6dac50ba7c59","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-dcpo-exponential]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-lambda-category","status":"resolved","id":"9d52b8330bc1b384","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-lambda-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dcpo-function-space","status":"resolved","id":"a101152a4f31cd83","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D$ 为小 dcpo，$\\alpha:D\\to[D,D]$、$\\beta:[D,D]\\to D$ 连续且互逆；函数空间见 [[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]，其指数定理见 [[16-thm-dcpo-exponential]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-dcpo-exponential","status":"resolved","id":"6e7c6dac50ba7c59","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D$ 为小 dcpo，$\\alpha:D\\to[D,D]$、$\\beta:[D,D]\\to D$ 连续且互逆；函数空间见 [[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]，其指数定理见 [[16-thm-dcpo-exponential]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-lambda-category","status":"resolved","id":"9d52b8330bc1b384","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D^n$ 的坐标从 $0$ 开始，$D^1$ 的元素是单元组 $(d)$；$a_D:D^2\\to D^1$ 为下文定义的带单元组输出的应用函数。$\\mathcal D_D$ 的终对象是自然数 $0$，指定反身对象是自然数 $1$；它们分别代表 $D^0$ 与 $D^1$。$\\mathrm{LambdaStr}$ 使用下文给出的终对象 $0$、积对象 $n\\otimes m$、投影与配对。$\\rho\\mathbin{+\\!+}\\sigma$ 表示长度分别为 $n,m$ 的有限元组拼接；$\\tau_{<n}$、$\\tau_{\\ge n}$ 分别为长度 $n,m$ 的两段。$\\mathrm{LambdaStr}$ 见 [[16-df-lambda-category]]；$\\Lambda_D$ 下文取 $D^{n+1}=D^n\\times D$ 的坐标约定，$D^n\\to D$ 的函数 $g$ 对应到对象 $1$ 的范畴箭头 $\\langle n,1,\\rho\\mapsto(g(\\rho))\\rangle$。应用与抽象的定义式中 $x,y\\in D$、$\\rho\\in D^n$、$f\\in[D^{n+1},D]$，$\\Lambda_D$ 随 $n$ 形成函数族。$\\mathrm{LambdaModel}(D)$ 是本页明确限定的存在结构谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]]，$\\mathrm{ScottCont}$ 采用 [[16-df-cpo]]；$\\mathrm{LambdaModel}$ 是本页定义的新谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cpo","status":"resolved","id":"d561a55729f9cdb8","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]]，$\\mathrm{ScottCont}$ 采用 [[16-df-cpo]]；$\\mathrm{LambdaModel}$ 是本页定义的新谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-inverse-limit","status":"resolved","id":"6cb45d716150df5b","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Example 2.5.3(ii), p. 156 (PDF 176)；泛性质为 Lemma 2.5.2, p. 155 (PDF 175)。本页完整构造书中的有限幂基范畴，并核对 λ 范畴接口；没有把两个 β/η 元素等式直接替代范畴构造。$\\mathrm{LambdaModel}$ 在此限定为反身 dcpo 模型存在性，不是未经定义的任意演算可靠性谓词。[[16-thm-inverse-limit]] 给出一项有本地证明的具体反身域构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha:D\\to[D,D]","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta:[D,D]\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"D^0=\\{()\\}","display":false},{"tex":"D^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle n,m,f\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"s,t,e,c","display":false},{"tex":"n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:D^k\\to D^n","display":false},{"tex":"g:D^k\\to D^m","display":false},{"tex":"D^n","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"D^1","display":false},{"tex":"(d)","display":false},{"tex":"a_D:D^2\\to D^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_D","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"D^0","display":false},{"tex":"D^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LambdaStr}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"n\\otimes m","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\mathbin{+\\!+}\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"n,m","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{<n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\ge n}","display":false},{"tex":"n,m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LambdaStr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda_D","display":false},{"tex":"D^{n+1}=D^n\\times D","display":false},{"tex":"D^n\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle n,1,\\rho\\mapsto(g(\\rho))\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in D^n","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in[D^{n+1},D]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda_D","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LambdaModel}(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ScottCont}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LambdaModel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_D&\\coloneqq\\mathbb N,\\\\\nM_D&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,m,f\\rangle\\mid n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(f,D^n,D^m)\\},\\\\\ns_D\\langle n,m,f\\rangle&\\coloneqq n,&t_D\\langle n,m,f\\rangle&\\coloneqq m,\\\\\ne_D(n)&\\coloneqq\\langle n,n,\\operatorname{id}_{D^n}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_D(\\langle m,k,g\\rangle,\\langle n,m,f\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\langle n,k,g\\circ f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal D_D&\\coloneqq\\langle O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,e_D,c_D\\rangle,\\\\\n!_n&\\coloneqq\\langle n,0,\\rho\\mapsto()\\rangle,\\qquad n\\otimes m\\coloneqq n+m,\\\\\n\\pi^{n,m}_1&\\coloneqq\\langle n+m,n,\\tau\\mapsto\\tau_{<n}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\pi^{n,m}_2&\\coloneqq\\langle n+m,m,\\tau\\mapsto\\tau_{\\ge n}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\langle\\langle k,n,f\\rangle,\\langle k,m,g\\rangle\\rangle_D\n&\\coloneqq\\langle k,n+m,\\rho\\mapsto f(\\rho)\\mathbin{+\\!+}g(\\rho)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\star_D&\\coloneqq\\langle0,1,()\\mapsto(\\beta(\\operatorname{id}_D))\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{app}_D&:D^2\\to D,\\qquad\n\\Lambda_D:[D^{n+1},D]\\to[D^n,D],\\\\\n\\operatorname{app}_D(x,y)&\\coloneqq\\alpha(x)(y),\\\\\na_D(x,y)&\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{app}_D(x,y)),\\\\\n\\Lambda_D(f)(\\rho)&\\coloneqq\\beta(y\\mapsto f(\\rho,y)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LambdaModel}(D)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists\\alpha,\\beta)\\bigl[\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\alpha,D,[D,D])\\land\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\beta,[D,D],D)\\\\\n&\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\alpha\\beta=\\operatorname{id}_{[D,D]}\n\\land\\beta\\alpha=\\operatorname{id}_D\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal D_D),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{LambdaStr}(\\mathcal D_D,1,\\langle2,1,a_D\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{LambdaModel}(D),\\\\\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N)(\\forall f\\in[D^{n+1},D])(\\forall\\rho\\in D^n)(\\forall y\\in D)\\\n\\operatorname{app}_D(\\Lambda_D(f)(\\rho),y)=f(\\rho,y),\\\\\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N)(\\forall h\\in[D^n,D])\\\n\\Lambda_D((\\rho,y)\\mapsto\\operatorname{app}_D(h(\\rho),y))=h.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"n+m","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta(\\operatorname{id}_D)\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda_D(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\beta=\\operatorname{id}","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha(h(\\rho))=(y\\mapsto f(\\rho,y))","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"h=\\Lambda_D(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LambdaModel}","display":false},{"tex":"D^1","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda_D(f):D^n\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\mapsto(\\Lambda_D(f)(\\rho))","display":false}],"bytes":5196,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-